config GPIO_BES2700IMP
	bool "BES2700iMP GPIO"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_BESTECHNIC_BES2700IMP_GPIO_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable GPIO input, push-pull output, and falling-edge interrupts on
	  boards with the GPIO pads configured by platform initialization.
